      "message": "Add Zaamo and Zalrsc extensions to RVI20U32 profile\n\nFixes #1523\n\nThe MISALIGNED_AMO parameter was missing from RVI20 CRD because\nthe profile only listed the A extension without explicitly including\nits sub-extensions Zaamo and Zalrsc.\n\nThis change adds explicit optional entries for Zaamo and Zalrsc\nextensions to ensure their parameters (MISALIGNED_AMO and\nLRSC_MISALIGNED_BEHAVIOR) are exposed in the generated CRD config.",
